      "content": "\"surviving\" sounds like just another way to keep the cycle going though. i'm just so tired of the cycle. it's like i'm just waiting for a relief that never comes. sometimes i look at everything and it feels like the most logical thing would just be to stop. to just let go of the struggle entirely. like, why is the only option to keep struggling? wouldn't it be more peaceful to just... not have to deal with any of this anymore?\n volunarily giving the noise of it all.  cabinet of",
